        "q1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Kérastase Densifique good for thinning hair in the Philippines?",
            "content": "<p>Yes — it is formulated for fine, low-density, or thinning hair, with Stemoxydine working at the scalp to support density. It's doubly relevant here, since humidity can make fine hair look flatter than it is: Densifique addresses both the immediate appearance of volume and the longer-term density concern. Choose Femme or Homme to match.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the difference between Densifique Femme and Homme?",
            "content": "<p>Both contain Stemoxydine. Femme adds Hyaluronic Acid, which hydrates the scalp and plumps the shaft; Homme adds Biotin, which supports keratin and suits the diffuse thinning more common in men. The routines share the same shape — a daily Cure vial plus the matching Densifique shampoo — with each formula tuned to its programme.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Kérastase Densifique treat male pattern baldness or alopecia?",
            "content": "<p>No — Densifique is not a treatment for androgenetic alopecia. It is a cosmetic density programme: it makes the hair you have look and feel fuller, and it can stimulate resting follicles to grow a hair fiber — but it cannot revive dead follicles in completely bald areas, and it cannot cure or reverse clinical male pattern baldness. For a receding pattern or established bald spots, see a dermatologist first; for thinning, low-density hair, Densifique is the cosmetic route.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can women use Kérastase Densifique Homme?",
            "content": "<p>Yes — the Stemoxydine works regardless of gender. The Homme formula carries Biotin instead of Hyaluronic Acid, so women with dry scalps won't get the same moisturizing benefit, while women with oily scalps may actually prefer the lighter Homme formula. If in doubt, confirm with a Kérastase-trained stylist.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does Kérastase Densifique take to work?",
            "content": "<p>The programme runs 90 days for full results, with early changes typically visible from day 30. Consistency is the key variable — missing vials interrupts the scalp's activation cycle. Most people notice fuller-feeling hair within the first month, with density building across the full course.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where can I buy Kérastase Densifique in the Philippines?",
            "content": "<p>HairMNL is an authorized Kérastase retailer, and both the Femme and Homme programmes are available — sourced through official channels, priced in pesos. Shop the full range at the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/collections/kerastase-densifique\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Densifique at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Kérastase Densifique collection</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
